Subject: [PATCH] fix: continue Codex reasoning-only incomplete responses

Carry encrypted reasoning state into a bounded follow-up request when the Responses API exhausts max output before producing a user-visible answer. Also classify retryable early EOF transport failures and cover both behaviors with regression tests.
